        <UserObject label="" tooltip="Adds MongoDB, an SFTP server and the DQ engine to the Phase 1 Docker stack. Click to open the implementation repository." link="https://github.com/srimarrivada/Enterprise-Data-Platform-Evolution-Reference-Implementation" id="r9e1">
