        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;YAML Manifest (one per source)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;endpoint | auth | response_groups | pagination | rate_limit | retries | watermark | extraction_mode (incremental / full / effective-dated)" tooltip="Design decision: adding a new API = adding a YAML file, no code change. Watermarks are persisted after successful landing only (at-least-once, idempotent re-runs)." id="yaml">
